Initial generation (20–25s) — run:

python scripts/generate_initial.py (show reports/initial_candidates.json)

Open reports/initial_candidates.json, show a few sample descriptions.

Initial execution (30–45s) — run executor:

python scripts/execute_candidates.py --file reports/initial_candidates.json --top 5 --label run_initial

Show the run folder and one console.log and report.json.

Ingest / Train (20–25s) — run:

python scripts/ingest_knowledge.py (show "Persisted X chunks")

Generate after (20–25s) — run:

python scripts/generate_after.py

Open reports/after_candidates.json, show differences vs initial.

Execute after (30–45s) — run:

python scripts/execute_candidates.py --file reports/after_candidates.json --top 5 --label run_after

Show artifacts in reports/runs/run_after/.

Compare (20–30s) — run:

python scripts/compare_candidates.py

Open reports/compare_initial_after.md and highlight improvements (e.g., added sleeps, changed selectors, clarified steps).